OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 30 APR
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GLinton Stephens introduces an
OL,11,     Gafternoon of specially made
OL,12,     Grecordings including music from
OL,13,     GLeipzig and chamber performances
OL,14,     Gfrom the BBC Radio 3 New
OL,15,     GGeneration artists.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Saint-Saens
OL,17,     GDonald Macleod follows Saint-
OL,18,     GSaens through a period shaped by
OL,19,     Gexile, opportunity and an
OL,20,     Gunexpected marriage, as his
OL,21,     Gcreative focus shifts towards the
OL,22,     Gstage.
