OL,13,     GCellist Nicolas Altstaedt and
OL,14,     Gpianist Denes Varjon join The
OL,15,     GHalle for Kurtag's Double
OL,16,     GConcerto, before Thomas Ades
OL,17,     Gconducts his own work Lieux
OL,18,     Gretrouves and Debussy's vivid
OL,19,     GImages.
